    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "分叉状态与日程",
        "kind": "highlights",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Glamsterdam 已成功部署到 Sepolia。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:13:20",
            "seek": 800.0
          },
          {
            "text": "提议在 10 月 28 日启动 Hegotá-devnet-0，合并 frames 与 FOCIL 开发网。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:32:47",
            "seek": 1967.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "测试进展",
        "kind": "highlights",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "EthPandaOps 表示 frames-devnet-0 运行正常；spamoor 每个区块发送约 10 笔帧交易。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:14:18",
            "seek": 858.0
          },
          {
            "text": "frames-devnet-1 范围包括 EIP-8250（带键 nonce）、EIP-8272（近期根）和 EIP-7906，目标于 10 月 15 日周四启动。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:27:52",
            "seek": 1672.0
          },
          {
            "text": "为 devnet-1 测试，将验证前缀上限提高到 50 万 gas。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:39:42",
            "seek": 2382.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Hegotá 提案",
        "kind": "highlights",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "EIP-8250 通过系统合约实现带键 nonce，被认为是临时拼凑的方案，但 PBT 之前没有更好的替代方案；已确认未来可以迁移。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:18:47",
            "seek": 1127.0
          },
          {
            "text": "EIP-8141 改动：用 Nick’s method（靓号地址）部署过期验证器，Matt 将在会后合并。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:34:44",
            "seek": 2084.0
          },
          {
            "text": "EIP-8141 基于 maxFee 的成本上限方案源自 EIP-7999，推迟到 devnet-2；Nethermind 和 Marc 尚未审查。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:34:52",
            "seek": 2092.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "FOCIL 与帧交易策略",
        "kind": "highlights",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "计划从 frames-devnet-1 进入合并 frames 与 FOCIL 的 Hegotá-devnet-0，合并后停止单独运行两个开发网。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:31:02",
            "seek": 1862.0
          },
          {
            "text": "FOCIL 已运行在 FOCIL-devnet-1 上，devnet-0 曾崩溃；合并开发网的范围将在周四 ACDE 会议决定。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:45:26",
            "seek": 2726.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "决策",
        "kind": "decisions",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "确认 frames-devnet-1 纳入 EIP-8250、EIP-8272 和 EIP-7906，推迟 EIP-8253 与 EIP-7979。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:27:52",
            "seek": 1672.0
          },
          {
            "text": "frames-devnet-1 的验证前缀上限设为 50 万 gas。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:39:42",
            "seek": 2382.0
          },
          {
            "text": "Hegotá-devnet-0 启动后，停止单独运行 FOCIL 和 frames 开发网，后续工作统一到 Hegotá 开发网。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:43:00",
            "seek": 2580.0
          },
          {
            "text": "基于 maxFee 的成本上限不进入 devnet-1；采用 Nick’s method 的过期验证器改动立即推进合并。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:36:14",
            "seek": 2174.0
          },
          {
            "text": "Daniil 的可变下限验证额度提案尚无结论；lightclient 反对缺少节点通信机制的方案，Daniil 已确认收到反馈。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:52:28",
            "seek": 3148.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "行动项",
        "kind": "actions",
        "items": [
          {
            "owner": "All teams",
            "text": "在 frames-devnet-1 启动前审查 EIP-8141 帧交易规范的 13 个开放 PR。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:53:44",
            "seek": 3224.0
          },
          {
            "owner": "Client teams",
            "text": "审查并回应 Daniil 的 PR：将 MaxVerifyGas 定义为交易池下限，而非硬上限。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:50:44",
            "seek": 3044.0
          }
        ]
      },
